					<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/>
						<paragraph leftIndent="4"/>
					</textElement>
					<text><![CDATA[Any foreclosure of the Loan shall attract prepayment charges at the rate of:

(a) 4% (four percent) of the outstanding amount of Loan in case prepayment is effectuated before the payment of 50% (fifty percent) of the total EMIs payable (in number) under the Loan

(b) 3% (three percent) of the outstanding amount of Loan in case prepayment is effectuated after the payment of 50% (fifty percent) of the total EMIs payable (in number) under the Loan.]]></text>
