		<band height="700" splitType="Stretch">
			<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
			<frame>
				<reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="0" width="495" height="700" uuid="24000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<staticText>
					<reportElement style="TableCell" stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="700" uuid="24000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000001">
						<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
					</reportElement>
					<textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10"/>
					</textElement>
					<text><![CDATA[xxiv.]]></text>
				</staticText>
				<staticText>
					<reportElement style="TableCell" stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="40" y="0" width="145" height="700" uuid="24000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000001">
						<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
					</reportElement>
					<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10" isBold="true"/>
						<paragraph leftIndent="4"/>
					</textElement>
					<text><![CDATA[General Conditions]]></text>
				</staticText>
				<staticText>
					<reportElement style="TableCell" stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="185" y="0" width="310" height="700" uuid="24000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000001">
						<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
					</reportElement>
					<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/>
						<paragraph leftIndent="4"/>
					</textElement>
					<text><![CDATA[1. The Borrower agrees and authorises the Lender to debit to and recover from any account maintained by on or behalf of the Borrower with the Lender, now or in future, towards recovery of any and all costs, charges and expenses stipulated herein or in connection with or incidental to the Loan.

2. The Borrower shall upon demand pay to or reimburse the Lender in full:
   a. The legal costs of the preparation of financing/security document, creation of security etc.;
   b. All costs, expenses and other charges at actuals including but not limited to all costs, expenses and fees relating to the periodic valuation, title search, site visit, inspection, insurance and protection/preservation in any other manner of the security tendered to the Lender; and
   c. All costs (including legal fees) incurred by the Lender in preserving perfecting or enforcing any of its rights under or in respect of this letter/financing documents, or any present or future security and other documents.

3. Borrower understands, acknowledges and agrees that the undrawn portion of the Loan may be cancelled and repudiated in part or in entirety by the Lender, at any time without notice and without giving any reason.

4. All costs, charges, interest rates are exclusive of applicable taxes.

5. Change in Applicable Rate of Interest and other pricing parameters may be communicated by the Lender through any of the following modes - through Email ID as updated in Lender's records, letter sent to Borrower's address as updated in Lender's records, over website of the Lender, through account statements, through Short Message Service (SMS) or through its branches or such other medium as the Lender may consider appropriate.

6. I /We hereby authorize and give consent to SFPL to disclose without notice to me/us, information furnished by me/us in application form/related documents executed/or to be executed in relation to the loans availed from SFPL, to SFPL's other branches, subsidiaries, affiliates, group companies & sister concerns, credit bureaus, rating agencies, service providers, banks/financial institutions, Government/Regulatory authorities or third parties for KYC information verification, credit risk analysis, or for other related purposes that SFPL may deem fit. I /We waive the privilege of privacy and privacy of contract. I /We hereby authorize SFPL to conduct a credit bureau check based on details furnished with respect to the loan application.

7. Release of Original movable / immovable property documents: Borrower can collect the original movable/ immovable property documents from the branch where the loan account was serviced, within 30 days after full repayment/settlement of the loan.

8. The Company does not charge any fee for regular EMI repayment. Repayments made through third-party payment gateways via the Mobile App or any other online mode may attract convenience fees/ service charges levied by the third-party payment service providers, where applicable.]]></text>
				</staticText>
			</frame>
		</band>
		<band height="20" splitType="Stretch">
			<frame>
				<reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="0" width="495" height="20" uuid="25000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001">
					<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$P{displayConditions} != null && $P{displayConditions} == true]]></printWhenExpression>
